019\/09\/20190908_104621.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"Originally, Dunkirk&#039;s belfry was the entrance to Saint-\u00c9loi Church.\" data-attachment-id=\"4841\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Originally, Dunkirk&#039;s belfry was the entrance to Saint-\u00c9loi Church.\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2019\/09\/20190908_104621\/915886419.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22150%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20150%20150%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><\/span><span class=\"fg-image-overlay\"><\/span><\/a><figcaption class=\"fg-caption\"><div class=\"fg-caption-inner\"><div class=\"fg-caption-title\">Originally, Dunkirk's belfry was the entrance to Saint-\u00c9loi Church.<\/div><\/div><\/figcaption><\/figure><div class=\"fg-loader\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fg-item fg-type-image fg-idle\"><figure class=\"fg-item-inner\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190908_104719.jpg\" data-caption-title=\"After the fire of 1585, the part that connected the bell-tower to the church collapsed. The remains were however left to connect the bell-tower to the church until 1782.\" data-attachment-id=\"4842\" class=\"fg-thumb\"><span class=\"fg-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"After the fire of 1585, the part that connected the bell-tower to the church collapsed. The remains were however left to connect the bell-tower to the church until 1782.\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"skip-lazy fg-image\" data-src-fg=\"https:\/\/iboishin.github.io/portfolio-website\/wp-content\/uploads\/cache\/2019\/09\/20190908_104719\/3708931578.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22150%22%20height%3D%22